Synthetic Oh My Pi session transcript in the real JSONL line shape (modelled on scripts/e2e/lib/testdata/stage4b-tools-session.jsonl, lines 1-4), written by hand for P10's two handoff_complete calls (one refused CHECK_WAKE_REQUIRED without wake_at, one accepted with wake_at, plus one non-legion bash call that the reader must skip). Fixture F2 (packages/pi-legion/scripts/skill-scenarios/testdata/f2/) is the real transcript of a lane R run; this file stays for the refused-then-accepted pair, which F2 does not hold.
